# Generated manifests. Derived entirely from the vault's tracked .md/.mdx sources,
# so tracking them buys nothing and costs a merge conflict on every parallel branch
# that skins a note — gallery/manifest.json carries a wall-clock `generated` stamp on
# line 2, so it conflicts even when the content is identical. `pnpm dev|build|test`
# regenerate them first. See [[0100-generated-visuals-manifests-are-not-tracked]].
src/gallery/manifest.json
src/notes/notes-manifest.json
